<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clastĭdĭum</span></b> ,
			ĭi, n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A fortress in</i> Gallia Cisalpina, <i>near the Padus</i>, now <i>Chiasteggio</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Tusc. 4, 22, 49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Hann. 4, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 21, 48,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The name of a fragment of Nœvius</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 7, 107</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 78</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
